# .chezmoiignore — patterns match TARGET paths (e.g. ".claude/plugins/cache/**"),
# NOT source names. The previous version used source-style names with a leading
# dot (".dot_claude/plugins/cache/**") so every rule silently matched nothing,
# and 332 cache files were tracked as a result. Rewritten 2026-09-11.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
